1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,831
Your friend stopped knocking.

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,266
That's your fault.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,227
Remember their first visit?

4
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,487
They waited at your open door.

5
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,815
You said, come in. Anytime.

6
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,227
Now they do.

7
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:12,180
Tonight,

8
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,434
you woke with a hand around your wrist.

9
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,005
Your friend's voice,

10
00:00:16,005 --> 00:00:17,489
inches from your ear.

11
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,428
You said anytime.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,566
You switched on the lamp.

13
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,110
In the mirror,

14
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,437
you could see your wrist.

15
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,642
But not the hand around it.

16
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,239
Then it pulled.
